Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是一个巨大的闪光灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a giant strobe light…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧穿了我的双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}burning right through my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知道为什么我还能看得见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们像烧焦的纸片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children look like burnt paper…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑漆漆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}black…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一动不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着爆炸产生的冲击波击中他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the blast wave hits them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像树叶一样四处飞散\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they fly apart like leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于世界末日的梦是很常见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreams of the end of the world are very common.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不是梦 蠢货 是真实的场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a dream, you moron. It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道发生的日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the date it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:00:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你的感受确实很真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it feels very real to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,1997年8月29日\N{\fnArial\fs30}On August 29th, 1997,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈也会觉得非常真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna feel pretty fuckin' real to you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要是没涂两百万的防晒霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody not wearing two million.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天都会惨不忍睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}sunblock is gonna have a real bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get it? - Sarah…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你觉得自己活得很安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you think you're safe and alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经死了 所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're already dead. Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 你 你们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him, you! You're dead already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方 全都不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole place, everything you see is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈才是活在梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one living in a fucking dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道这事确实发生过 发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I know it happened! It happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经有这样一个未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There once was a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类被会思考的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which humankind was hunted…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及为杀戮而生的终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a machine that could think…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,追捕猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Terminators built to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个毫无希望的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A future without hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（0，200）\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（30.6，227.2）\c&HEBF4F8&}危地马拉利文斯顿 1998年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那种未来没有发生 因为我阻止了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That future never happened because I stopped it…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect my son…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也为了拯救人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to save us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HADC4B0&\fn方正大黑_GBK\pos（166.8，116.8）}扫描模式25784\N目标分析
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HADC4B0&\fn方正大黑_GBK\pos（157.8，127.2）}栅格精度\N模式35016 854
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs12\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HADC4B0&\fn方正大黑_GBK\pos（275.4，184.8）}目标匹配\N编号342-589\N任务资料\N康纳 约翰\N身高 42856 55378\N体重 55867 63489\N头发 20002 85612\N眼睛 38468 01254\N性别 78133 76287\N面部
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs18\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HADC4B0&\fn方正大黑_GBK\pos（202.2，249.6）}目标已终结
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:04:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经拯救了三十亿生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I saved three billion lives…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却救不了我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't save my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个机器从我身边夺走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}A machine took him from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也终结了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（1200，0）\fs23\b1\bord0\shad1\pos（192，125）} 终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（1500，0）\b1\bord0\shad1\fs10\pos（192，170）}黑 暗 命 运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（2500，500）\fs10\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（31.8，225.2）}墨西哥城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（500，500）\fs10\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（60.6，224.8）}22年后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.45,0:04:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我也有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你就打算坐在那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}快过去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}她还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我们拿她怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}站住别动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}别动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}警官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我们只是想帮助这位女士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你朋友怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我们都不认识她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}别碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你们给她嗑了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}她是从桥上掉下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}最好是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}天上掉裸体美女这种事我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}放开他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}太厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just saved our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别着急谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}去死吧 女人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}行了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}「我们帮帮她」 「她受伤了」 都是你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}早上好 莫娜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:07:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}总是带着花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}总是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}要玉米粽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}好的 我给迭戈带一个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我能顺块芒果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟 早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little brother. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了玉米粽和玉米粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought tamales and atole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}好香
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}快看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}147个赞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我很快就能超过布鲁诺·马尔斯了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想在美国成为大人物 该怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you want to be big in America, you would say…?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会超过布鲁诺·马尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to pass Bruno Mars…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}pronto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:08:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}塔科
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你觉得这件怎么样
