Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}别小题大做了 达妮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你怎么这么顽固
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我天生就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}现在改变你不觉得晚了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}-玉米饼很好吃 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 迭戈 我们要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Diego. We're running late.
