Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你说了算
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}拜拜 塔科
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}茱莉亚 我正在想你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你都想了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:09:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:09:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我刚刚在把妹 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had something going there. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看到了 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw it. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我撩的太过火了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I was flirting with her too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你一开口就让人受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think all the parts where you were talking were too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}塔科 安静点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我找达妮娜·拉莫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我是她朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}她朋友都叫她达妮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}没错 确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs12\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（285.6，137.6）}亚流汽车厂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工位上来了个新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new guy at my station.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}真酷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑切斯先生 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor Sanchez, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}未来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}克雷格让你去办公室见他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去我的工位 - 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take my spot. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}他要见的不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}打扰一下 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我家孩子又忘带午饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮·拉莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani Ramos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}规矩很清楚 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}头盔和背心不能少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你穿成这样可不能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 格拉蒙德先生 他可是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mr. Grummond. It's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是达妮 他又不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dani, he ain't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有三千个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}3, 000 people out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if I tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们随时会被机器取代 会有什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're just keeping a spot warm for some machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你爸怎么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你怎么来了 爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你们又忘带午饭了 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}达妮已经帮我们打包好午饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}达妮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}她在跟老板谈话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}他们要用那破机器取代我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}她什么时候回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}她来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个机器 而且是被派来杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a machine that was sent here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me go! - You come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则不出三十秒你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're dead in the next 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是救你命的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the person saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Dani.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在我身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样杀不死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得走了 快 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta go. Move! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Diego!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我们那东西是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell us what that thing is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个终结者 Rev-9型\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Terminator. A Rev-9.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是从未来派过来的 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was sent here from the future. I was, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是机器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a machine, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我跟你们一样是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm human like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你的手臂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, your arm…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是强化人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm augmented.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 强化人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Augmented?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 再开快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster! Go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很害怕 但我是来保护你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're scared, but I am here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 达妮 你是我的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Dani. You're my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.31,0:19:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 再快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go faster! Go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos（200，160）\fs20\b1\bord0\shad0}检查引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.94,0:20:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你会开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Can you drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不会 - 我会 我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I mean, I can't… - I can! I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.08,0:20:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稳住 - 格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold it. - Grace…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 系好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani, put your seat belt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.15,0:22:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Diego!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 把他弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.37,0:22:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 他会失血过多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. He will bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.60,0:22:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.93,0:22:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senor?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.97,0:22:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达妮 我们得走了 - 我是不会丢下他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dani, we have to go. - I'm not leaving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.15,0:23:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她走 保护好她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her. Save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.65,0:23:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迭戈 - 达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diego! - Dani!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.93,0:23:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 达妮 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani! Dani, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 不然他就白死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go, or he died for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他们开始杀我时 你就跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they start to kill me, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.87,0:24:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.18,0:25:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.80,0:25:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他妈是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.38,0:25:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.56,0:25:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得赶紧走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.10,0:25:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是那个女士的车 - 你不走它就会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grace, it's that lady's car. - Dani, you go or it kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.38,0:25:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.43,0:25:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.56,0:25:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.38,0:26:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.63,0:26:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面可能有\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can maybe look in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.96,0:26:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.64,0:26:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.40,0:26:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.97,0:26:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把迭戈的事告诉爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell my father about Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.89,0:26:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.22,0:26:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不知道迭戈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know about Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得见我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.90,0:26:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.61,0:26:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,复制人类需要进行身体接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs physical contact to copy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.07,0:26:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,被复制的人活不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they don't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.46,0:26:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.87,0:26:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.72,0:27:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm crashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.48,0:27:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上滚烫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.78,0:27:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新陈代谢只适合短暂的爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}My metabolism was tuned for short, intense bursts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.27,0:27:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么在几分钟内阻止终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You either stop a Terminator in the first few minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.24,0:27:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.94,0:27:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.19,0:27:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.40,0:27:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.74,0:27:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到车上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.94,0:28:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连路都走不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't even walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.87,0:28:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.65,0:28:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找警察 它就会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that, it'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.29,0:28:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找一百个警察来对抗终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put a hundred cops between you and a Terminator…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.17,0:28:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百个警察都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll get a hundred dead cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.83,0:28:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.09,0:28:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 来后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.51,0:28:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说你不会开车的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said you can't drive. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.95,0:28:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我边开边学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.93,0:29:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.39,0:29:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.39,0:29:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠 你还真重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, you're heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.07,0:29:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.10,0:29:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}小姐 你需要帮助吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.06,0:29:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}我们没事 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}来人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.86,0:29:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}需要帮…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.68,0:29:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要抗癫痫药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need any anticonvulsant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.38,0:29:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚苯乙烯磺酸钠 胰岛素 苯二氮平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sodium polystyrene sulfonate, insulin, benzodiazepine…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.66,0:29:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有医生处方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a doctor's prescription?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的处方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my prescription.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.04,0:29:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.38,0:29:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.13,0:30:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.60,0:30:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}非常抱歉 有人要杀我们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.52,0:30:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.04,0:30:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.66,0:30:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.86,0:30:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.56,0:30:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.96,0:30:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}让我帮你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.27,0:31:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I save your ass…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.46,0:31:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们却偷了我的车 真行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you steal my truck. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.78,0:31:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.94,0:31:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 车都废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. It's burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.95,0:31:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.22,0:31:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.31,0:31:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是病了还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sick or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.02,0:31:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找你俩问清楚情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I need answers from you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把她抬上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get her in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.37,0:31:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我 免得你伤到自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that before you hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.23,0:31:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.06,0:31:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是达妮娜·拉莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Daniella Ramos.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.69,0:31:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.13,0:31:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.79,0:31:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 你肯定很重要 不然他们也不会派…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dani, you must be somebody, or they wouldn't have sent…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.77,0:31:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这样的来保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever she is to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有手机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.27,0:32:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有啊 - 能给我看一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Could I see it for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.26,0:32:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.53,0:32:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不如戴个跟踪手环呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well be wearing a tracking bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.17,0:32:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我准备好要干掉那个东西时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm ready to kill that thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.78,0:32:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自然会让它知道我们的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'll let it know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.17,0:32:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该用浴缸才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have done this in the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你看到哪里有浴缸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen the bathtub?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的手机装在薯片袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep my cell phone in the chip bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.20,0:32:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,铝箔能阻隔GPS信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The foil blocks the GPS signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.14,0:32:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们就无法追踪到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can't track me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.06,0:32:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在追踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's trying to track you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.49,0:32:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在几个州被通缉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wanted in a couple of states.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是50个州\N{\fnArial\fs30}50, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么要十包呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why 10 bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.24,0:33:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我特别爱吃薯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I really like potato chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.71,0:33:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her meds…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.04,0:33:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道每一种需要多少剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you know how much of each to use?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.14,0:33:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.70,0:33:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.74,0:33:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.69,0:33:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.17,0:33:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他在车里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in the truck when…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.22,0:34:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能让他 还有我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will be there to bury him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,入土为安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.58,0:34:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No funerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.73,0:34:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人跟他们道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one there to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.02,0:34:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,葬礼救不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funerals don't help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.92,0:34:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,道别也帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And goodbyes don't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.10,0:34:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能学着接受这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to learn to live with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.63,0:34:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, base.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.93,0:34:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是蜻蜓三号 请求近距空中支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dragonfly Three requesting close air support.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.83,0:34:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在五公里外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are five klicks out,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,运送重要伤员 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}carrying wounded precious cargo. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.19,0:34:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 蜻蜓三号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Dragonfly Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.52,0:34:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意五号方位有敌人靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised there are hostiles inbound on vector five.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.95,0:34:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢救小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trauma crew is standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.87,0:34:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在南侧隧道等候指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}by for the commander at the south tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.54,0:35:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rev-7型在追击我们 随意开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have Rev-7s in pursuit. Weapons free.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.88,0:35:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.41,0:35:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上下来 回撤 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off there now! Move back! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.67,0:35:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.38,0:35:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把指挥官带进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the commander inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.17,0:35:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.06,0:36:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三个 跟我来 拖住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You three, with me! Hold them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.37,0:36:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.28,0:36:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.67,0:36:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们寡不敌众 需要立刻增援\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're being overrun! We need reinforcements now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.71,0:36:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover her!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.50,0:36:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.58,0:36:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.66,0:36:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她多处被刺伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got multiple stab wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.37,0:36:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸部创伤严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of chest trauma here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.91,0:36:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快将这些伤口缝合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get these holes sealed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.51,0:36:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在右侧插入胸管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a chest tube in the right side.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.62,0:37:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下会疼得你想骂娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna hurt like a motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.17,0:37:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.96,0:37:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.58,0:37:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 插好了 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.28,0:37:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得保护你们的指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to protect your commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.80,0:37:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸亏有你 指挥官现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The commander is safe, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.37,0:37:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 士兵 你能挺过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, soldier. You'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.69,0:37:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.14,0:37:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我变成强化人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me an Augment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸骨正中切口 胸骨柄切开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midline sternotomy with manubrial splitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,肺部压缩 心脏定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lung deflation and cardiac localization.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's gear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.88,0:37:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.00,0:37:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.59,0:37:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.30,0:37:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.50,0:37:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.70,0:37:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.68,0:38:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sarah! Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.67,0:38:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.68,0:38:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 没事 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.09,0:38:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.50,0:38:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.37,0:38:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我锁在屋子外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked me out of the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.79,0:38:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候家长要讨论大人的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes mommies and daddies have to have grown-up discussions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你是来保护她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're here to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.57,0:38:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.56,0:38:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前从没见过像你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen one like you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.91,0:38:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎就和人类一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost human.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.68,0:38:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am human.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.90,0:38:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是强化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enhanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.49,0:38:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度更快 力量更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, increased speed and strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.54,0:38:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,微型钍反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}thorium micro-reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.21,0:38:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说你要是惹毛我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means I can rip your throat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.78,0:38:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能一把掐死你 所以别惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you piss me off, so don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.43,0:38:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪个年代来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.48,0:38:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,2042年\N{\fnArial\fs30}2042.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.59,0:38:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.88,0:39:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.78,0:39:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和她差不多年纪的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was about her age…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.71,0:39:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个终结者被派来杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Terminator was sent to kill me…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.63,0:39:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止我的儿子约翰出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop the birth of my son, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗军的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leader of the Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.13,0:39:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个反抗军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which resistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.71,0:39:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类反抗军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.40,0:39:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟天网对抗的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against Skynet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.78,0:39:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个要消灭全人类的人工智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The AI that's trying to wipe us all out?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.77,0:39:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.95,0:39:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.02,0:39:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是约翰和我改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}John and I changed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.49,0:39:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们改变了未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We changed the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.66,0:39:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救了三十亿人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved three billion lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.69,0:39:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.30,0:39:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的儿子现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your son now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.19,0:40:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网派了好几个终结者追杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet had sent several Terminators to hunt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.52,0:40:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个最终找到了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}One finally caught up with us and…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.34,0:40:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行了来自没有发生的未来的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}carried out orders from a future that never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.85,0:40:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since then…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.38,0:40:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在猎杀终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hunt Terminators.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.27,0:40:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,整日喝酒到不省人事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I drink till I black out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.17,0:40:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的自我介绍够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of a resume for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.25,0:40:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.09,0:40:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们会上那条高速\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know we'd be on that freeway?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.36,0:40:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,面试结束 我们该动身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interview's over. We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.45,0:40:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.34,0:40:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」是不存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no "We."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.77,0:40:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮是和我一起的 保护她是我的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani's with me. It's my mission to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.38,0:40:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.44,0:40:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that working out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.31,0:40:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你对这个时代的了解还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly you don't know everything about this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.18,0:41:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个带手机的人都是行走的传感器平台\N{\fnArial\fs30}How anyone with a phone is a walking sensor platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.01,0:41:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个十字路口 每个加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}How every intersection, every gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.51,0:41:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个便利店都有摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 7-Eleven has cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.70,0:41:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界上的每个人都会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody walks through this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.14,0:41:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,两公里范围内留下数码痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}without leaving a digital trail a mile wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.65,0:41:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那个追杀她的终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my guess is that Terminator hunting her…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.87,0:41:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以随时获取那些数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}can access that data anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.47,0:41:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩是撑不过十小时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two won't last 10 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.61,0:41:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把话说明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get something straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.02,0:41:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你让她陷入危险 或者碍着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you put her in danger or you get in my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.05,0:41:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就搞死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fuck you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.41,0:41:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.99,0:41:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.44,0:41:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个机器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that machine…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.85,0:41:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who sent it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.03,0:42:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道对方什么来头 我就没法对付它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fight it if I don't know what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.85,0:42:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是终结者Rev-7型\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Rev-9 model.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.42,0:42:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对付不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.27,0:42:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.86,0:42:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但是什么人派来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but who sent it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.95,0:42:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not who.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.84,0:42:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是什么东西 而且不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What. And it wasn't some…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.24,0:42:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.48,0:42:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在真正发生的未来里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future that actually happened…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.33,0:42:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它叫「军团」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's called Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.91,0:42:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.80,0:42:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为网络战争打造的人工智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}An AI built for cyber warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.09,0:42:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些混蛋真是不长教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those assholes never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.51,0:42:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它展开了攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.28,0:42:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 攻击谁 - 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Attacked who? - Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.92,0:42:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody. Humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.50,0:42:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 你怎么知道我们会在那架桥上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, how did you know we would be on that bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.82,0:42:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会收到信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get these texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.27,0:42:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,精准坐标定位 日期 时间 精确到秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precise GPS coordinates, dates, times, down to the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.36,0:42:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些信息结尾都会有出现四个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always end with the same two words.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.79,0:42:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「为了约翰」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For John."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.77,0:43:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就带上所有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I pack up every weapon I've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.44,0:43:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去定位的地方 干掉任何惹我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I head to those coordinates to kill whoever is messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.16,0:43:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个停车场上的空气被撕裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The air splits open above a parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.24,0:43:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一个终结者掉了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Terminator drops out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.68,0:43:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它摧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.78,0:43:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后过了两年 同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then two years later, same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.61,0:43:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,位置 时间 日期 「为了约翰」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location, time, date, "For John."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.46,0:43:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那个也干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I frag that one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.27,0:43:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周我收到两条信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And last week, I get two texts,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.22,0:43:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在墨西哥城\N{\fnArial\fs30}both in Mexico City.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.11,0:43:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查到是谁发的信息了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever find out who sends those texts?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.45,0:43:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 信息总是加密过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They're always encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.83,0:43:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息还在你手机上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still have them on your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.28,0:43:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.57,0:43:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.85,0:43:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Future shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.05,0:43:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.75,0:44:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些信息是从拉雷多市郊发出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These texts came from outside Laredo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.05,0:44:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.04,0:44:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的指挥官让人在我身上纹了这个坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}my commander had them tattoo these coordinates on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.37,0:44:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我记不住似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if I couldn't remember shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.68,0:44:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我要是任务出了岔子就去这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told me to go here in case anything went sideways with my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.44,0:44:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方就是给你发信息的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same location your texts come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.60,0:44:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你发信息的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever sent you these texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.40,0:44:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们让我求助的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the same person I was told to go to for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.82,0:44:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我们要去德州了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we're going to Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.89,0:44:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和一个没有签证的墨西哥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna cross the U.S. Border with an undocumented Mexican national.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.35,0:44:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有美国头号女通缉犯一起穿过美国边境吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a woman who had her own episode on America's Most Wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.69,0:44:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识可以帮我们穿过边境的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know someone who can get us across.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.07,0:44:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你信得过的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone you trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.89,0:44:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. My uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.14,0:44:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得弃车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we need to ditch the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.12,0:44:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,销声匿迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.55,0:45:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要在乎她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you care what happens to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.59,0:45:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.36,0:45:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她就是曾经的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.06,0:45:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那感觉糟糕透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.52,0:45:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样确实销声匿迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is off the grid, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.46,0:45:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望没有这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wish it wasn't so crowded here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.19,0:45:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你俩没这么白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wish you two weren't so white.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.34,0:45:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, chicas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.67,0:46:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.52,0:46:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（500，0）\fs12\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（125.2，226.667）}墨西哥城
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.23,0:46:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（800，0）\fs12\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（32，226.133）}拉西姆数据中心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.33,0:46:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（168.8，169.067）}英雄市\N特卡马卡州
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.29,0:47:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（202.4，131.733）}拉雷多市\N德州
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.17,0:47:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, tell me what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.27,0:47:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切是怎么破灭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when this all falls apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.31,0:47:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.01,0:47:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有预警\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.00,0:47:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一天 一切都停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day one, everything just stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.47,0:47:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机用不了 没有电 城市陷入黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No phones, no power. Cities go dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.00,0:47:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 待在原地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.76,0:47:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.52,0:47:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.71,0:47:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道一切恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}just until things got back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.77,0:48:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是再也没恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}But normal was never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.36,0:48:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day two,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.07,0:48:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发射了核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}they launched nukes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.66,0:48:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为电磁脉冲打击能压制军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought they could contain Legion with tactical EMP strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.62,0:48:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了第三天 整个世界都陷入了战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by day three, the whole world was at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.13,0:48:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,数百万人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions died.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.34,0:48:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等食物消耗完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, when the food ran out,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.76,0:48:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,数十亿死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.18,0:48:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个人因为一罐桃子杀了我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some men killed my dad over a can of peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.06,0:48:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.86,0:48:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们以为战争已经结束了时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we thought the worst was over,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.23,0:48:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,军团开始猎杀幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Legion started to hunt survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.57,0:49:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你有吃的 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you got food, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.19,0:49:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.87,0:49:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后的几年我都不知道自己怎么撑过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how I made it through the next few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.21,0:49:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量不去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just try not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.88,0:49:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.09,0:49:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone found me,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.76,0:49:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}saved me,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.85,0:50:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们开始反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we started fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.73,0:50:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.60,0:50:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮生的孩子可以阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani gives birth to the one man that can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.57,0:50:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 未来想要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The future wants you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.03,0:50:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟想要我死的原因一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the same reason it wanted me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.03,0:50:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只是个小人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm nothing. I'm nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.20,0:50:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你不是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're not the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.92,0:50:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的子宫是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.67,0:50:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 暂时换个人当圣母玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Let someone else be Mother Mary for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.80,0:50:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是圣母玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're Mother Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.97,0:50:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我这么想揍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}why do I so wanna beat the shit outta you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.68,0:51:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.42,0:51:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.65,0:51:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你好 我的小美女
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.19,0:51:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你来这里干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.35,0:52:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的客户都能安全穿过边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}My clients get across safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.77,0:52:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,追求更好的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a better life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.81,0:52:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和别人不同 不会让他们在沙漠里等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't leave them to die in the desert as some others do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.02,0:52:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我们穿过边境吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get us across the border?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.78,0:52:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但外国佬通常不是我的客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but gringas are not my usual clientele.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.78,0:52:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个做了什么非法的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two do something illegal maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.16,0:52:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮不愿说的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something my Dani doesn't wish to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.58,0:52:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔 有个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tio, there's…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.25,0:52:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事听起来很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is going to sound crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.80,0:52:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但外面有个机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a machine out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.01,0:52:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.47,0:52:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它杀死了爸爸和迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what killed Papi and Diego,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.18,0:52:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it wants to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.26,0:52:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得摆脱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.10,0:52:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这理由挺新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.69,0:53:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝也算半个机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace is part machine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.22,0:53:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.72,0:53:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs14\b1\bord0\shad1}无人机\N作战与空中监控\N禁区
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.85,0:53:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.94,0:53:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.11,0:53:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是和边境巡逻一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that just like the Border Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.24,0:53:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到了五分钟 而且没给我们带甜甜圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes late, and neglects to bring us donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.16,0:53:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰伦斯 闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrance, shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.44,0:54:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你不想知道在追我们的是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.15,0:54:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}达妮 我是个偷渡蛇头
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.82,0:54:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}总有人在追我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.02,0:54:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬33接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin 33 in contact with.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.36,0:54:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林桥正西方的交叉路口\N{\fnArial\fs30}intersection due west of the Greene Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.60,0:54:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,911 格里芬33遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}9-11 Griffin 33 wilco.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.57,0:54:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬33 911 那就是目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin 33 9-11, that is your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.71,0:54:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.88,0:54:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一公里到河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more kilometer to the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.34,0:54:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.88,0:54:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.35,0:54:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有无人机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a drone up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.97,0:54:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.48,0:54:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你又不是来自未来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you're not an augmented super soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.23,0:54:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,强化超级士兵 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the future, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.02,0:55:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.11,0:55:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 所有巡逻队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, all patrols.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.69,0:55:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 现在通知最新坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised, new coordinates issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.24,0:55:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌疑人此刻位于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspects are now 220 meters south.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.57,0:55:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,7B检查站以南220米处\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Checkpoint 7-Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.03,0:55:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,已知他们是锡那罗亚贩毒集团的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are known members of the Sinaloa Cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.37,0:55:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国与墨西哥当局都在通缉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted by American and Mexican authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.62,0:55:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,预计他们携有武器 十分危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be considered armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.88,0:55:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,允许致命打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadly force is authorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.30,0:55:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到墙边之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you reach the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.64,0:55:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有一扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a door beneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.60,0:55:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗拉科会为你们带路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flacco will show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.91,0:55:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.21,0:56:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.38,0:56:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 美国边境巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! U.S. Border Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.39,0:56:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器扔到地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your weapons on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.76,0:56:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们被关起来 它来找她 她就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get locked up, it comes for her, she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.06,0:56:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna tell you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.65,0:56:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器扔到地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.31,0:56:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.69,0:56:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani! Dani!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.15,0:56:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以射杀我 但我不能看着你们死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can shoot me, but I'm not watching you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.91,0:56:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.32,0:56:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.12,0:56:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们把我和她分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they separate me from her,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.00,0:56:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请把她救出去 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- please get her out of there. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.62,0:56:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前走 远离你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk forward and away from your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.21,0:56:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.27,0:57:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.57,0:57:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绑好了吗 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You get them? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.47,0:57:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}长官 那女孩是我的孙女
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.22,0:57:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}她受伤了 我需要陪着她
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.20,0:57:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,已拘捕一名男性嫌疑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have one male suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.62,0:57:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,与三名女性嫌疑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and three female suspects in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.67,0:57:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.06,0:57:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要援助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.10,0:58:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（1200，0）\fs12\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（31.2，188.267）}美国边境巡逻拘留中心
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.31,0:58:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（1200，0）\fs12\b1\bord0\shad0\pos（31.2，225.067）}德州 拉雷多
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.50,0:58:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但我没空听你废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, but I don't have time for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.46,0:58:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这也不是我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.21,0:58:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要基本信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need basic information.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.17,0:58:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓名 年龄 国籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name, age, country of origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.84,0:58:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的 警官 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the truth, ma'am. I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.63,0:58:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个机器杀死了我弟弟和我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This machine, it killed my brother and my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.14,0:58:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在还想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now it wants to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.64,0:58:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.06,0:58:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 警官 请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Officer, you have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.77,0:58:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in danger, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.40,0:58:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我在审核中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm in Processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.40,0:58:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你回到你来的地方之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to save your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.36,0:58:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再讲你的故事吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}till you get where you're going, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.53,0:58:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,心率有些高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart rate slightly elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.07,0:58:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,肺部没问题 来看一下伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lungs are clear. Let's get that wound exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.83,0:58:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,气管无偏移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trachea's midline.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.25,0:58:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下有没有刺穿伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check for any exit wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.26,0:58:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜身搜得挺好啊 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice body search, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.39,0:59:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.61,0:59:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过类似的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.73,0:59:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍些照片吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get some pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.61,0:59:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,已确认 已经派人监视了 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's confirmed. We have eyes on it now. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.66,0:59:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被临时派来接一名刚收押的被拘留者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got TDY'd here to pick up a new detainee.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.70,0:59:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被关在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they being held?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.87,0:59:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,去行政警官那里签到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check in with the desk sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.79,0:59:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会指示你的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll direct you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.44,0:59:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evenin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.94,0:59:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接一名被拘留者 达妮·拉莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposed to pick up a detainee. Dani Ramos.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.53,0:59:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请寄存你的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please locker your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.95,1:00:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她经受了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's been done to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.62,1:00:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身体里这么多东西是怎么活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she even alive with all this stuff in her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.63,1:00:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证警报器会响 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expect a big ping, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.80,1:00:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的全身就是一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole body's a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.13,1:00:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着给女士讲去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it for the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.47,1:00:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 金属髋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Metal hip.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.84,1:00:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次阿富汗驻派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two tours in Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.06,1:00:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 感谢你为国家效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.52,1:00:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.69,1:00:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.91,1:00:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是里格比警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Officer Rigby.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.37,1:00:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.25,1:00:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.96,1:00:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're famous.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.63,1:00:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里抓到的名人可不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't get a lot of famous around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.30,1:01:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.80,1:01:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有自己的单人牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belong in your own private cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.01,1:01:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.25,1:01:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.72,1:01:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我允许你们看我的私处了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I say you can look at my private parts?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.85,1:01:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的囚犯都被关在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do they take the new prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.31,1:01:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该叫被拘留者 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're called detainees and we…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.94,1:01:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被送到了最南边的扣押区 等待审核…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're taken to the south end holding area for processing…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.40,1:02:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.23,1:02:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0}火警
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.40,1:02:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.77,1:02:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的高级居住区在二楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our senior living section is on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.52,1:03:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace! Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.03,1:03:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 他来了 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - He's here. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.07,1:03:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来 大家都回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Everybody, get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.56,1:04:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.24,1:04:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.91,1:04:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.79,1:04:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉来了 她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Sarah. She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.38,1:04:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没时间了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no time. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.67,1:04:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会丢下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I'm not leaving her!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.72,1:04:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.56,1:04:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.18,1:04:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 带上她 - 上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah, get her! - Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.71,1:05:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 你需要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani, you need to understand something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.09,1:05:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再做这样的傻事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do stupid shit like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.84,1:05:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能拿自己的命冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot put yourself at risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.26,1:05:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他本会杀了莎拉 - 那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He would have killed Sarah. - That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.68,1:05:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候才会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you gonna get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.93,1:05:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你活不下来 所有人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody dies if you don't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.28,1:05:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.40,1:05:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.41,1:05:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.41,1:05:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是来看闹剧的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all come to see the shitshow?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.08,1:05:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.75,1:05:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,被拘留者趁机逃脱 打开了所有的牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detainee got loose, unlocked all the cages,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.92,1:05:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}just chaos from there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.63,1:05:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不瞒你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind tellin' you,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.30,1:05:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才五分钟里我把这辈子的祈祷都做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed more in five minutes than I have my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.01,1:05:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.18,1:06:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,打听一下 你们知道哪能搞到直升机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, you boys know where I can get my hands on a chopper?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.77,1:06:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在坐标上方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're over the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.40,1:06:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离一公里处着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land a klick short.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.55,1:06:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs14\b1\bord0\shad0}卡尔窗饰\N我们从不让你空窗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.09,1:06:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔吗 这就是你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Carl? That's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.60,1:06:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔就是那个神秘发信人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl's the mystery texter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.96,1:07:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.84,1:07:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.59,1:07:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.84,1:07:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.47,1:07:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.85,1:07:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.72,1:07:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪给我 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me have it! - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.06,1:07:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 你得冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, you need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.14,1:07:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西杀了约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing killed John!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.23,1:07:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是真的吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that true? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.15,1:07:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not what you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.44,1:07:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.15,1:07:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.70,1:07:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是这个人能帮我们 - 他不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If this man can help us… - Not a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.91,1:07:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Terminator.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.12,1:07:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝他脸上来一枪 看看他身体里什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him in the face and see what's underneath!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.41,1:07:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎他是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.62,1:07:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.23,1:08:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你是 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you're a… - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.94,1:08:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化人系统101型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyberdyne Systems Model 101.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.61,1:08:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问问你的身份吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask what you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.07,1:08:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.50,1:08:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.10,1:08:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一张约翰的照片都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a photograph of John.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.32,1:09:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没拍过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never took any.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.95,1:09:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.37,1:09:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不知道他的样貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}they couldn't find him…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.25,1:09:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就无法找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they didn't know what he looked like.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.09,1:09:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在快忘了他的长相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I'm forgetting his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.06,1:09:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.44,1:09:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那姑娘被盯上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why is the girl targeted?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.19,1:09:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.36,1:09:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码告诉我你是怎么找到我的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can you at least tell me how you found me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.12,1:09:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁给你的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave you that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.43,1:10:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.65,1:10:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请坐下 - 废话少说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please sit down. - Cut the shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.49,1:10:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice family.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.37,1:10:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是终结者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She a Terminator, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.62,1:10:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的终结者小孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your little Terminator kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.46,1:10:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫马特奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Mateo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.55,1:10:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀死约翰几个月后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met his mother, Alicia,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.01,1:10:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到了马特奥的母亲艾丽西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few months after I killed John.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.30,1:10:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准提他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't get to say his name.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.60,1:10:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的丈夫虐打她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her husband had beaten her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.39,1:10:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图杀了她儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trying to kill her child.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.48,1:10:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无处可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.40,1:11:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾这个家庭给了我生活目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caring for this family gave me purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.07,1:11:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有目标 我们就什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause without purpose, we are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.15,1:11:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,感人的故事 你到底想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touching story. Does it have a point?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.86,1:11:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抚养我的儿子 马特奥时\N{\fnArial\fs30}While raising Mateo, my son,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.62,1:11:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始理解我从你那里夺走了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I began to understand what I had taken from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.87,1:11:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你逐渐生出了良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You grew a conscience?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.04,1:11:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多的东西吧 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The equivalent of one, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.88,1:11:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是个潜入者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an infiltrator.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.92,1:11:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.71,1:11:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务完结后 就没有别的指令了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my mission was completed, there were no further orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.05,1:11:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此在二十年间 我不断地学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for 20 years, I kept learning.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.64,1:11:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何变得更像人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to become more human.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.43,1:11:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些信息呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about the texts?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.97,1:11:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间错位一旦发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}When chronal displacement occurs.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.31,1:11:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在错位事件之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a shockwave through time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.89,1:11:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,会出现一道时间上可测量的震荡波\N{\fnArial\fs30}measurable before the event.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.65,1:11:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是方法 不是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how, not why.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.19,1:11:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了给你目标 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}To give you purpose, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.53,1:11:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这样你儿子的死就有意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it would bring meaning to your son's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.87,1:11:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎样让我儿子的死有意义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what would give meaning to his death?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.12,1:12:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.84,1:12:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将很难对艾丽西亚解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be very hard to explain to Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.27,1:12:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是个终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Terminator!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.38,1:12:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们正在同一个终结者开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are fighting a Terminator.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.39,1:12:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个我们无法抵挡的终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that we can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.21,1:12:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信命运吗 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in fate, Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.76,1:12:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说 你相信我们每分每秒所做的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you believe that we all can change the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.97,1:12:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,都能够改变未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}every second by every choice that we make?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.77,1:12:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了改变未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.89,1:12:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了毁灭天网\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose to destroy Skynet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.39,1:12:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You set me free.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.57,1:12:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.89,1:12:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你保护那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to help you protect the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.36,1:12:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我选择如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I choose to.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.71,1:12:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艾丽西亚回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.48,1:12:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要我帮忙把买的菜拿进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs my help with the groceries.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.23,1:13:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 宝贝 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, honey. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.15,1:13:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里来客人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have company.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.76,1:13:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人 是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company? Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.99,1:13:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,热水足够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there enough hot water?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.45,1:13:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 足够 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, thank you. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.27,1:13:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.73,1:13:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 你的朋友看起来饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, your friends look hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.15,1:13:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃点三明治或者薯片之类的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like some sandwiches and chips or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.41,1:13:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意不错 艾丽西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great idea, Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.07,1:13:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特奥 去帮你妈妈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mateo, why don't you go and help your mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.95,1:13:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 爸 我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Dad. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.35,1:13:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.23,1:13:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都这么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what everyone calls me, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.72,1:13:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈永远不会叫你卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never gonna fucking call you Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.62,1:14:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.95,1:14:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 她没注意你体重超过180公斤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - She hasn't noticed that you weigh 400 pounds?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.64,1:14:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没发现你从来不睡觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you never sleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.07,1:14:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是肉体关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our relationship is not physical.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.32,1:14:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换尿布麻利又不抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}She appreciated that I could change diapers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.62,1:14:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Efficiently and without any complaints.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.13,1:14:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很可靠 我擅长倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am reliable, I'm a very good listener.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.10,1:14:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还非常幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm extremely funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.14,1:14:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.83,1:14:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么阻止这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.77,1:14:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们选好我们的武器和场地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We choose our weapons and our ground,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.97,1:14:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,设置一个杀戮陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}we set up a kill box,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.70,1:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用达妮引它过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we use Dani to bring it to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.55,1:14:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 然后干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - And then we take it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.61,1:14:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 达妮不能当诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way. Dani is not bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.71,1:14:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah is right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.89,1:14:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的一个战略优势就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our one tactical advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.86,1:14:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结者眼里只有任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that the Terminator only sees its mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.22,1:14:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮去哪里他就跟去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever Dani goes, he will follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.76,1:14:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确如此 我会等着他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right it will. And I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.10,1:14:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让她给你们冒险当诱饵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not about to stake her out like some goat for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.70,1:14:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你有什么计划 接着逃跑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your plan? More running?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.86,1:15:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划是把她藏起来 即便藏到矿井下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan is to hide her at the bottom of a mineshaft if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.19,1:15:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少藏到我 - 别吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At least until I… - Just stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.37,1:15:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会藏到矿井底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hiding at the bottom of a mineshaft.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.81,1:15:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拒绝在恐惧中度过余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna live in fear the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.14,1:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你的计划意味着我命不久矣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if your plan means that might not be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.64,1:15:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要挺身反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.73,1:15:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们选好我们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we choose our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.54,1:15:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及场地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.82,1:15:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要设置一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna set up a…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.36,1:15:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀戮陷阱 - 杀戮陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill box. - Kill box.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.44,1:15:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 用我做诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, we're gonna use me as bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.74,1:15:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我们杀掉那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, we kill that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.39,1:15:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.34,1:15:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划成功率很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}This plan has a high probability of success.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.92,1:15:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.58,1:15:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}What weapons?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.03,1:16:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直备着这些东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just keep these around?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.18,1:16:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便不被失控的人工智能统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even without a rogue AI taking over,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.71,1:16:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我计算过 人类的文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I calculate a 74% chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.05,1:16:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有74%的概率会毁灭 重归野蛮\N{\fnArial\fs30}that human civilization will collapse into barbarism.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.11,1:16:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了那个最终的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in that eventuality,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.73,1:16:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些武器会是保护我的家人的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}these weapons will be vital to protect my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.89,1:16:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.44,1:16:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是德州\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Texas.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.47,1:16:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始 连射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Rapid fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.48,1:16:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要试着缓解后坐力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're anticipating the recoil.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.45,1:16:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,重心前移 手臂举高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your weight forward, arms up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.93,1:16:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿再站开一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wider stance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.19,1:16:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,手肘不要绷得太紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lock out your elbows.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.14,1:16:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of this bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.67,1:16:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来动真格的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.41,1:17:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个终结者刚刚杀了你全家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Terminator has just killed your whole family.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.65,1:17:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.52,1:17:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这些枪杀不死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know these guns won't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.60,1:17:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能拖慢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll only slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.91,1:17:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你对他能力的描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to your description of his capabilities,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.70,1:17:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好的选择就是弄到一把军用能量武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}our best option is to secure a military-grade energy weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.84,1:17:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,EMP吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}An EMP?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.16,1:17:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.39,1:17:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,电磁脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}An electromagnetic pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.37,1:17:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们近距离使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we had one close range,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.82,1:17:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能摧毁Rev-9\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would fry a Rev-9.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.19,1:17:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许认识一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might know a guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.41,1:17:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,宾厄姆的空军情报官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air Force intelligence officer out of Bingham.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.73,1:17:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里151公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 94 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.52,1:17:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天下午就出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.20,1:17:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.88,1:17:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在跟踪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been tracking me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.41,1:18:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要把手机放在薯片袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to keep your phone in a bag of potato chips,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.47,1:18:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}then keep your phone in a bag of potato chips.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.54,1:18:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 照顾好妈妈 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take good care of Mama. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.53,1:18:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.59,1:19:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他们说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.30,1:19:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他们你们的到来 让这个地方不安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them you coming here makes this place unsafe for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.24,1:19:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我曾警告他们可能会来的那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, the day I warned them might come,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.38,1:19:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}has come.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.92,1:19:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的过去来找我算账了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My past has caught up with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.78,1:19:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.39,1:19:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.72,1:19:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you love them?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.39,1:19:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是人类的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like a human can.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.40,1:19:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来我一直认为这是种优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}For many years I thought it was an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.44,1:19:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.07,1:19:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.02,1:20:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.69,1:20:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等达妮安全了 这一切都结束后\N{\fnArial\fs30}that when Dani's safe and this is all over,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.50,1:20:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.25,1:20:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.39,1:21:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不仅仅是要选对颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's much more to it than just picking the right color.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.38,1:21:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要考虑的是质感 材料的重量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the texture, the weight of the material.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.18,1:21:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个错误的选择 - 莎拉 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One wrong choice… - Sarah, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.49,1:21:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,会破坏整个房间的观感\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can destroy the look of the entire room.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.21,1:21:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 之前有一个客户来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - There was this one customer that came to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.92,1:21:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想在一个小女孩的房间里挂上纯色窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to have solid-color drapes in a little girl's room.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.25,1:21:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 「千万别」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Don't do it."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.02,1:21:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要蝴蝶 圆点 气球\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need butterflies, polka dots, balloons.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.20,1:22:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.06,1:22:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是很高兴见到你 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always good to see you, Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你一点都不高兴 康纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never good to see you, Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.72,1:22:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我带了生日礼物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my birthday present?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.59,1:22:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Sarah,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.44,1:22:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会随便为一个人犯叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't commit treason for just anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.84,1:22:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个电磁脉冲对四级强度目标的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the range of the EMP.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.64,1:22:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,射程是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}against a Class Four hardened target?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.10,1:22:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,保镖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.86,1:22:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是做窗帘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do drapes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.10,1:22:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我行动小组的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's part of my operations team.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.03,1:22:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他应该把嘴闭好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he should just shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.70,1:22:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校 宾厄姆有哪种直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major, what kind of helos fly out of Bingham?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.36,1:23:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑鹰和支努干 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Hawks and Chinooks. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.01,1:23:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's found us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.87,1:23:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.92,1:23:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.91,1:23:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都上车了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.50,1:23:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,往基地开 沿着这条路走大约三公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for the base. About two miles down this road.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.15,1:24:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它马上就会追过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be on us again in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.44,1:24:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Major Dean,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.59,1:24:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,第361情报监视侦察小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}361st Intelligence, Surveillance, and Reconnaissance Group.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.25,1:24:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣布进入一级战备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Declaring ThreatCon Delta.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.55,1:24:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在宾厄姆空军基地以南\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm currently two miles south.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.96,1:24:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,三公里的白色面包车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Bingham Air Base in a white van.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,正向西门行驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headed for the west gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.52,1:24:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌方正驾驶被盗的警用直升机追赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pursued by hostiles in a stolen police helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.17,1:24:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.93,1:24:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些士兵不能帮助我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't all those soldiers back there help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.84,1:24:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能拖慢它 但杀不掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be able to slow it down, but they can't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.71,1:24:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-5货机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The C-5.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.09,1:24:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fly that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.68,1:24:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.28,1:24:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在进入未经许可的领空\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are entering unauthorized airspace.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.31,1:24:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻掉头 否则我们就开火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around now or we will open fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.84,1:24:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.68,1:24:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.80,1:25:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.71,1:25:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是地区承包商 友军\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are district contractors. Friendlies.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.65,1:25:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽我所能掩护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do what I can to cover your backs.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.20,1:25:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至你们能起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you can get airborne.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.66,1:25:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有获得授权 拦住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, they're not clear! Stop 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.92,1:25:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\b0\bord0\shad0\3c&H01001E&\c&H828291&\pos（190.4，248.533）}扫描模式
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.20,1:25:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\b0\bord0\shad0\pos（8.4，67.733）\3c&H01001E&\c&H828291&}匹配模式\N威胁分析
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.29,1:25:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\b0\bord0\shad0\pos（337.2，152.533）\3c&H01001E&\c&H828291&}扫描层级
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.00,1:25:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs12\b0\bord0\shad0\pos（96.8，83.733）\3c&H01001E&\c&H828291&}分辨率调整\N威胁识别
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.73,1:25:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\b0\bord0\shad0\3c&H01001E&\c&H828291&\pos（8.4，82.667）}优先级超控\N威胁评估：紧迫
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.96,1:25:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\b0\bord0\shad0\3c&H01001E&\c&H828291&\pos（217.2，153.6）}坐标方位\N威胁类型\N飞行路径
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.09,1:25:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又被他锁定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been reacquired.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.82,1:25:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.90,1:25:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.39,1:26:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.57,1:26:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.02,1:27:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉破坏了你的小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your shed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.58,1:27:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥42 这里是毒蛇16 保持警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge 42, this is Viper 16. Stay in tension.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.53,1:27:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他们不会把我们打下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully they won't shoot us down.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.41,1:27:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,神鹰行动 这是毒蛇16\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noble Eagle Ops, this is Viper 16.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.90,1:27:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.88,1:27:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后再想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figuring that out next.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.79,1:27:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些悍马车可以直接降落伞着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those Humvees are rigged for parachute landing,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.48,1:27:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以着陆后\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can punch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.98,1:27:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个偏僻的地方使用电磁脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then find some remote spot to use the EMP.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.64,1:27:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.38,1:28:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 如果我们不用这个跟他打 能赢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… if we fight him without those, can we win?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.26,1:28:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,基于我们现有的武器 我估计胜算是12%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on the weapons we have, I estimate our chances at 12%.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.23,1:28:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不是毫无胜算啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.31,1:28:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也好不到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.59,1:28:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就去找更多的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have to find some more weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.34,1:28:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按计划行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.89,1:28:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们设陷阱然后就能 - 不 达妮 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We set the trap and then we can… - No, Dani, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.81,1:28:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.04,1:28:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我儿子会拯救我们所有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my son is supposed to save us all?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.22,1:28:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And until then, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.22,1:28:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就眼睁睁看着人们死去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just keep watching people die?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.06,1:28:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的未来取决于你成功…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future of the human race depends on you making it…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.43,1:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管什么未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a shit about the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.50,1:28:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者是我将来某天会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what I'm maybe supposed to do someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.65,1:28:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是我们现在做出的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}What matters are the choices we make now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.74,1:28:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种表情我以前见过太多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that look too many times before.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.19,1:28:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.83,1:28:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.81,1:28:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.49,1:29:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.92,1:29:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.45,1:29:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在审判日之后的废墟中找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}who found me in the ruins after Judgment Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.01,1:29:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.13,1:29:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀者\N{\fnArial\fs30}HKs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.97,1:29:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪啊 十秒内我们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me, and we'll all be dead in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.26,1:29:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,军团就想要我们这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what Legion wants us to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.49,1:29:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.52,1:30:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该和机器战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be fighting the machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.18,1:30:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么意义 我们赢不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point? We can't win.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.87,1:30:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,军团是人类创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legion didn't exist until humans created it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.64,1:30:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西是我们制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.02,1:30:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.09,1:30:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为机器要我们躺下等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we supposed to lie down and die.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.93,1:30:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就应该照做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}because some machine decided it?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.13,1:30:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们的命运吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that our fate?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.66,1:30:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那去他的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, fuck fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.65,1:30:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.45,1:30:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.16,1:30:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.56,1:31:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫达妮娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Daniella.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.21,1:31:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.70,1:31:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.29,1:31:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你养育了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you raised me,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.42,1:31:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教会了我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you taught me to hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.17,1:31:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你拯救并教会其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you saved and taught the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.85,1:31:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把拾荒者变成了民兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned scavengers into militias.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.69,1:31:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把民兵又变成了军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and militias into an army.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.28,1:31:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在灰烬中重生 夺回了我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rose up out of the ashes and we took our world back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.72,1:31:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教会我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.66,1:31:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运不是注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.89,1:31:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是自己创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what we make for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.69,1:31:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.84,1:31:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是未来某个救世主的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are not the mother of some man who saves the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.43,1:32:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.68,1:32:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以军团要追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Legion wants you dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.44,1:32:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's John.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.79,1:32:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're John.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.33,1:32:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉之前没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't tell you this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.33,1:32:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说我将会见到的过去的达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you told me that the Dani I'd meet in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.24,1:32:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法接受这个现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.43,1:32:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不再是那个达妮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not that Dani anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.16,1:32:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,DE12\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta Echo 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.12,1:32:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是KC-320\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is KC-320.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.16,1:32:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to refuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.98,1:32:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.79,1:32:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 KC-320 但你是不是来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, KC-320, but aren't you a bit early?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.02,1:32:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.23,1:32:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.71,1:32:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上悍马车坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap in to the Humvee.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.36,1:33:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.45,1:33:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}自动驾驶仪开启
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.95,1:33:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.90,1:34:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.07,1:34:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.56,1:34:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开货舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the cargo bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.68,1:34:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}地面货舱门
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.52,1:35:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.94,1:35:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 开门啊 - 卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah! The door? - It's jammed!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.25,1:36:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄断绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the straps.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.64,1:36:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.30,1:36:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.66,1:37:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 她人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace! Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.03,1:37:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.88,1:37:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.01,1:37:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来两个 他们要运进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got two more. They're bringing 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.00,1:37:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.32,1:37:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.31,1:37:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.35,1:37:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你死了 - 我们降落得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you were dead. - We're dropping too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.28,1:38:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.78,1:38:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 操\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My God! - Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.94,1:38:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 快下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani, get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.91,1:38:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挡住了 - 要掉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's blocked! - It's not gonna hold!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.32,1:38:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.31,1:39:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.03,1:39:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.95,1:39:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我的肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - My shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.81,1:39:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱臼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dislocated.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.30,1:39:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会看病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're a doctor now?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.95,1:39:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.78,1:39:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了 我们不能待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming. We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.65,1:39:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.12,1:39:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.50,1:39:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 格雷丝 真要这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Grace. Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.76,1:39:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap in!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.76,1:39:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不然多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Otherwise it could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.15,1:40:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找车灯开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to find the lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.62,1:40:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.97,1:40:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,后座有降落伞 拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a parachute back there. Grab it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.98,1:40:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以缠住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can tangle him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.71,1:40:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.02,1:41:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等它出现 你就拉这条绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes, you pull this cord.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.96,1:41:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cord.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.16,1:41:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你绕过它浮上水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you swim past it up to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.36,1:41:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.10,1:41:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.34,1:42:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.38,1:42:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.55,1:42:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.11,1:42:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.59,1:42:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.32,1:42:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.47,1:42:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走上去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you make it up there?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.29,1:42:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.16,1:42:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.05,1:42:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.12,1:42:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.60,1:43:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.84,1:43:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许有其他门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's maybe another door.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.18,1:43:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.10,1:43:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.50,1:43:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani, you have to run.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.97,1:43:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你快跑 我们保护不了你 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to run. We can't protect you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.92,1:43:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有我还能作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one of us who can still throw a punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.46,1:43:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.38,1:43:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.23,1:43:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}My power source.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.79,1:43:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么取出来才不会害死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get it out of you without killing you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.68,1:43:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做不到 - 那就不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.26,1:44:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.10,1:44:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.09,1:44:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我的脸还是完整的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I still have all my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.14,1:44:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个落在飞机上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left this on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.18,1:44:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不开那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get through that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.29,1:45:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.58,1:45:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.07,1:45:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离我们不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not far behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.52,1:45:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.57,1:45:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在这里决一死战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We make our stand here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.68,1:45:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我们的杀戮陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our kill box.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.44,1:45:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.61,1:45:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not running!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.64,1:46:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把女孩交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.80,1:46:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.89,1:46:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.80,1:46:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我为同一个目标而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I were built for the same purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.19,1:46:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而军团是唯一的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Legion is the only future.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.77,1:46:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就来自那样一个未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came from a future like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.40,1:46:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个失败的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.54,1:46:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你和她素不相识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she's a stranger to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.50,1:46:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不把她交给我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not just let me have her?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.68,1:46:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们不是机器 冷血混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're not machines, you metal motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.80,1:47:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.52,1:47:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.01,1:47:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.71,1:47:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.00,1:49:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.42,1:50:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Grace?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.61,1:50:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.79,1:50:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.94,1:50:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace! Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.09,1:50:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.40,1:50:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.70,1:50:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.85,1:50:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.36,1:51:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们得带你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. We gotta take you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.24,1:51:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 格雷丝 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Grace, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.41,1:51:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}My power source.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.23,1:51:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近它 电源就能毁了它的神经网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it close, and it'll fry his neural net.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.79,1:51:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.80,1:51:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.01,1:51:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.25,1:51:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dani.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.97,1:51:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我派来就为了这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you sent me here to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.52,1:51:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.03,1:51:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 我回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both knew I wasn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.35,1:51:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 达妮 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - Dani, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.31,1:52:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.09,1:52:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次让我救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.68,1:52:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.25,1:52:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.36,1:52:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快动手 达妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Dani.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.08,1:52:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.65,1:52:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也不遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.08,1:52:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}你夺走了我的一切 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.92,1:52:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（192，242）\shad1\bord0}现在…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.82,1:52:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you, fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.53,1:53:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.72,1:53:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help her!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.39,1:53:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.44,1:53:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.32,1:53:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.60,1:55:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}For John.
