Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.76,1:56:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打败它了 格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.16,1:56:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.48,1:56:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.22,1:56:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷丝 快来 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.58,1:56:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.14,1:57:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.24,1:57:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上自己的东西 小家伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your stuff, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.99,1:57:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再让她为我牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let her die for me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.00,1:57:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得做好准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you need to be ready.
